{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2021-07-30 06:30:00', 'title': 'FUNDEX EQUIPMENT TO OFFER TRIMBLE GROUNDWORKS MACHINE CONTROL SYSTEM FOR PILING RIG GUIDANCE', 'text': 'SUNNYVALE, CALIF. AND GOES, THE NETHERLANDS, JULY 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ:TRMB) AND FUNDEX EQUIPMENT ANNOUNCED TODAY THE AVAILABILITY OF THE TRIMBLE® GROUNDWORKS MACHINE CONTROL SYSTEM FOR PILING MACHINE GUIDANCE AS AN OPTION ON FUNDEX EQUIPMENT FOUNDATION MACHINES.'}